# These two hold legacy source content AND a redirect stub for the old URL.
# Ignore the contents but ship the stub, or /articles/ and /Testimonials/ 404 for anyone
# arriving from an old link. Written as dir/* rather than dir/ because git cannot
# re-include a file whose parent directory is itself excluded.
Testimonials/*
!Testimonials/index.html
articles/*
!articles/index.html
